  "title": "Reaching the unreachable: Pharma marketing in the age of evolving media habits",
  "summary": "In this MM+M podcast episode, industry leaders explore how pharma marketers can effectively reach healthcare providers and patients in today’s fragmented media landscape. Featuring insights from National CineMedia (NCM), the discussion covers the challenges of regulatory compliance, audience targeting, and media strategy—highlighting how high-impact channels like cinema are delivering real engagement and measurable results.",
